<Snapshot background="#F8F7F3" type="png"><Stack><SizedBox width="1200" height="1600" /><Positioned left="0" top="0"><Container width="1200" height="1600" color="#F8F7F3" /></Positioned><Positioned left="48" top="54"><Text fontSize="40" color="#171E33" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP" fontStyle="BOLD">布局：根尺寸来自布局树</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="992.0" top="64"><Text fontSize="20" color="#5C6474" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">第 2 页 · 共 4 页</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="48" top="106"><Text fontSize="24" color="#5C6474" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">有界 Row/Column/Expanded 与 Stack 定位对照</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="48" top="148"><Container width="1104" height="1" color="#E2DFD5" /></Positioned><Positioned left="48" top="182"><Container width="10" height="26" color="#1F7A5C" borderRadius="3" /></Positioned><Positioned left="70" top="178"><Text fontSize="28" color="#171E33" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP" fontStyle="BOLD">约束先有界，flex 才有剩余空间可分</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="48" top="228"><Text fontSize="24" color="#3A4152" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">根尺寸：Snapshot 自身不带宽高，画布 = 布局根的有限尺寸；本图由 400×240 的 SizedBox 决定。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="48" top="266"><Text fontSize="24" color="#3A4152" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">Row/Column 有界才按 flex 分配；Expanded 须是 Flex 直接子节点，上例剩余宽按 2:1 拆分。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="48" top="304"><Text fontSize="24" color="#3A4152" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">Stack 定位：非定位子项先依流排版，Positioned 子项用 left/top 绝对放置，可配宽高限定区域。</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="48" top="352"><Container width="432" height="308" color="#FFFFFF" borderRadius="12" border="1 SOLID #E2DFD5" /></Positioned><Positioned left="64" top="616"><Text fontSize="18" color="#5C6474" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">真实渲染 · 400×240</Text></Positioned><Positioned left="64" top="368"><Stack><SizedBox width="400" height="240" /><Positioned left="0" top="0"><Container width="400" height="240" color="#F2F4F8" /></Positioned>    <Container width="400" height="240" padding="20">
      <Column>
